    "message": "fix: retain protected ancestry and align Bazel library roots\n\nRetain historical and live HIA pins when classifying ordinary branch\nretirement, with complete-parent checks and a one-attempt journal.\nPreserve the 483 protected names and 504 recorded commit pins.\n\nPass the Cargo library root through the Bazel macro for extension-api,\nhepta-context-compiler, and hepta-prompt. Keep all Rust sources and locks.\n\nProtection regressions: original 18 pass; four new controls fail on the\nold implementation; candidate 31 pass normally and under Python -O.\nNative Bazel and final formatting remain pending after a runtime timeout.",
